# Cloudflare Workers static assets: response headers for the exported client
# (wrangler.jsonc). Limit on Workers Free: 100 rules.
#
# Release identity and the carry manifests must never be cached. Hashed
# chunks under /_next/static/ deliberately get no long max-age: a rule here
# would also apply to 404s, and a tab asking for a chunk that is missing would
# keep that 404 for the rule's lifetime. Cloudflare's default
# (max-age=0, must-revalidate, with an ETag) costs only free revalidations.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

/version.json
  Cache-Control: no-store, max-age=0

/releases.json
  Cache-Control: no-store, max-age=0

/release-assets.json
  Cache-Control: no-store, max-age=0

# Metadata images Next exports without a file extension.
/opengraph-image
  Content-Type: image/png

/twitter-image
  Content-Type: image/png

/icon
  Content-Type: image/png

/apple-icon
  Content-Type: image/png
